onesimusd (0.25.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split into two packages: onesimusd + brconsole
  * Tab-completion from Director AST, readline, syntax coloring
  * All CLI switches compatible with C++ bareos-dir
  * Config directory tree support (/etc/bareos/bareos-dir.d/)
  * 135 unit tests, 8192 parallel connections verified

